; Generic types (objfpc): generic TName<T> = ... is a template, declared but
; not checked; specialize TName<integer> is the type made of it (and of the
; implementations of its methods) for those type arguments, checked like
; any type, with a note at the use for errors in it.
; RUN: not %pcc --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 -c %S/Inputs/generictypes/errors.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
; CHECK: errors.pas:13:11: error: redefinition of generic 'TTwice'
; CHECK: errors.pas:10:11: note: previous definition is here
; CHECK: errors.pas:16:19: error: duplicate type parameter 'T'
; CHECK: errors.pas:48:11: error: generic types must be declared at program or unit level
; CHECK: errors.pas:55:6: error: 'TBox' is a generic; give its type arguments: specialize TBox<...>
; CHECK: errors.pas:56:17: error: 'TBox' is not a generic type with 2 type parameters
; CHECK: errors.pas:57:17: error: 'TNope' is not a generic type with 1 type parameter
; CHECK: errors.pas:58:17: error: 'TRec' is not a generic type with 1 type parameter
; CHECK: errors.pas:37:16: error: class 'TBox<integer>' has no method 'Nope'
; CHECK: errors.pas:8:15: error: method 'TBox<integer>.Missing' is declared but never implemented
; CHECK: errors.pas:59:17: note: in the specialization 'TBox<integer>' requested here
; CHECK: errors.pas:37:16: error: class 'TBox<ansistring>' has no method 'Nope'
; CHECK: errors.pas:8:15: error: method 'TBox<ansistring>.Missing' is declared but never implemented
; CHECK: errors.pas:60:17: note: in the specialization 'TBox<ansistring>' requested here
; CHECK: errors.pas:62:22: error: unknown type name 'Unknown'; did you mean 'IUnknown'?
; CHECK: errors.pas:67:5: error: assigning to 'TBox<ansistring>' from incompatible type 'TBox<integer>'
; CHECK: errors.pas:68:5: error: assigning to 'TSum<integer>' from incompatible type 'TSum<real>'
; CHECK: errors.pas:69:9: error: cannot pass a value of type 'string of length 4' to parameter 'v' of type 'integer'
; CHECK: errors.pas:70:8: error: 'TBox' is a generic; give its type arguments: specialize TBox<...>
; CHECK: errors.pas:34:19: error: invalid operands to '+' ('ansistring' and 'integer')
; CHECK: errors.pas:60:17: note: in the specialization 'TBox<ansistring>.Get' requested here
; CHECK: errors.pas:43:15: error: invalid operands to '+' ('TRec' and 'TRec')
; CHECK: errors.pas:61:17: note: in the specialization 'TSum<TRec>.Total' requested here
;
; RUN: not %pcc --mode=objfpc -c %S/Inputs/generictypes/syntax.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=SYNTAX %s
; SYNTAX: syntax.pas:3:20: error: expected '<' and type parameters after the name of a generic type
;
; RUN: not %pcc --mode=tp -c %S/Inputs/generictypes/tp.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=TP %s
; TP: tp.pas:3:10: error: expected '=' after type name
;
; The tree: the template; each specialization, a type declaration of the
; module with its methods' implementations; in an expression the type gets
; a hidden name.
; RUN: %pcc --mode=objfpc --emit-ast %S/Inputs/generictypes/ast.pas -o - | FileCheck --check-prefix=AST %s
; AST: GenericTypeDecl 'tbox' <t> <3:11>
; AST: TypeDecl 'tintbox' = class(TObject) <7:3>
; AST: FunctionDecl 'tbox.get' <8:1>
; AST: VarDecl 'b' : TBox<integer> <13:3>
; AST: VarDecl 's' : TBox<string> <14:3>
; AST: TypeDecl '$spec1' = class(TObject) <17:8>
; AST: TypeDecl 'tbox' = class(TObject) <3:11>
; AST-NEXT: FunctionDecl 'tbox.get' definition <8:1>
; AST: TypeDecl 'tbox' = class(TObject) <3:11>
; AST-NEXT: FunctionDecl 'tbox.get' definition <8:1>
;
; RUN: %pcc --mode=objfpc --emit-parse-tree %S/Inputs/generictypes/ast.pas -o - | FileCheck --check-prefix=TREE %s
; TREE: GenericTypeDecl 'tbox' <t> <3:11>
; TREE-NEXT: ClassTypeSpec
; TREE: SpecializeTypeSpec 'tbox' <7:13>
; TREE-NEXT: NamedTypeSpec 'integer'
